      "structure_description": "The discrete hexameric polyoxoanion contains a trefoil-shaped {Er12Se14W12} core anchored by six tetravacant Dawson-type {Se2W14} fragments. The core comprises three {Er3Se4W4} units arranged around a central {Er3Se2} cage; each peripheral unit is stabilized by two {Se2W14} fragments.",
