        "procedure": "Na2WO4·2H2O, dimethylammonium chloride, H2SeO3, and NaOAc·3H2O were dissolved in water with stirring. The pH was adjusted with HCl, Er(NO3)3·6H2O was added, the pH was readjusted, and CsCl was added. After stirring for 10 min, the solution was heated, cooled, filtered, and allowed to evaporate slowly.",
